The application of mobile supply varlet gives the seller a new opportunity. Now it allows consumers to buy products online from mobile phones.
It has all that we need for the purchase of gadgets - website, a catalog and sales of goods. All that users need in order not to experience any problems has a well-working service application.
The application was created using software Unity. The application was successfully tested on Android smartphones with a minimum size of 100×600. It was successfully distributed using Google Play. At the moment it is popular with 10 thousand downloads on Google Play.
In the application there are several sections:
The main section provides access to a comprehensive catalog of products manufactured by the mobile phone network provider. Each piece contains the following:
Information about product type;
Name of the seller;
Purchase price;
Description of the product;
A link to download photo;
Link to information about the company.
Search function. Allows you to enter a keyword of interest directly on the site or type it into the application.

, NJ
